 303:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_support.c **** /*
 304:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_support.c ****  * Each board can have it own way of communicating with the chip. The miim read and write function
